accept 1284 Suspicious Hoofprints
accept 11208 Delivery for Drazzit
turnin 11212 Tabetha's Farm
turnin Help for Mudsprocket | Drazzit Dripvalve, Mudsprocket (the goblin camp south of the marsh).
turnin 1252 Lieutenant Paval Reethe
turnin 1253 The Black Shield
turnin 1284 Suspicious Hoofprints
turnin 11208 Delivery for Drazzit
turnin 11214 Mission to Mudsprocket
fp Mudsprocket
accept Bloodfen Feathers | Brogg, Mudsprocket.
accept WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous | The wanted poster in Mudsprocket.
accept Catch a Dragon by the Tail | Gizzix Grimegurgle.
complete Bloodfen Feathers | Bloodfen Feathers from Bloodfen Razormaws west of Mudsprocket.
complete WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous | Goreclaw, a raptor among the Razormaws.
complete Catch a Dragon by the Tail | Wyrmtails from Searing Whelps south of Mudsprocket.
turnin Bloodfen Feathers
turnin Catch a Dragon by the Tail
turnin WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous | Drazzit Dripvalve.
accept 1259 Lieutenant Paval Reethe
turnin 1259 Lieutenant Paval Reethe
level 41
train
note Fly from Mudsprocket to Gadgetzan (Tanaris). Get the Gadgetzan flight path on arrival.
